#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0082 expect=skipped domain=LB
#note "LB is a FINDINGS-class dataset: Scope.Classes.Include [EVENTS] rejects it -> skipped. The data would otherwise fire: both LBBODSYS and LBBDSYCD are columns (Requirements pass), and the record has LBBODSYS populated with LBBDSYCD blank."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset LB class=FINDINGS label="Laboratory Test Results"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col LBSEQ    type=Num
col LBTESTCD type=Char
col LBBODSYS type=Char
col LBBDSYCD type=Num
---
S1 | LB | 001 | 1 | ALT | Hepatobiliary disorders | .
---
